{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/0bcbcfa9599c4019c7092ff276dd3bd0.avif?t=1758126060\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonfall Protocol</strong> is a fast-paced 1\u20134 player <strong>co-op survival</strong> horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are given a <strong>once-in-a-lifetime</strong> chance to walk on the <strong>moon</strong>. What starts as an exciting mission quickly turns into something worse. A hidden base, with strange astronauts guarding it, and a portal that pulls you into a <strong>twisted dimension</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, nothing stays the same. <br>The world shifts, entities stalk you, and every step feels like a race against time. <br>Work together to <strong>gather evidence</strong> of what really happened,\u00a0<strong>coins to upgrade your abilities</strong>, and hunt down <strong>ten control points</strong> to power the generator that could send you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.poster.avif?t=1758126060\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.webm?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.mp4?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.poster.avif?t=1758126060\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.webm?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.mp4?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless alien horrors across the surface of the moon and beyond. <br>Every second counts as you and your team fight, run, and adapt to unpredictable threats in shifting environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.poster.avif?t=1758126060\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.webm?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.mp4?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.poster.avif?t=1758126060\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.webm?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.mp4?t=1758126060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission isn\u2019t 